[en.DECISION_C08_MANEHATTAN_INVADE]
Media Warfare

[en.DECISION_C08_MANEHATTAN_INVADE_desc]
Utilize our agents in Manehattan to spread to the garrison, false information about the collapse of the business alliance, leading the enemy forces to disperse.

[zh.DECISION_C08_MANEHATTAN_INVADE]
宣传攻势

[zh.DECISION_C08_MANEHATTAN_INVADE_desc]
利用潜伏在马哈顿的特工，向守军发布商业联盟已经崩溃的假消息，引导敌方部队溃散。
